---
kind: lore
id: maud
title: Maud, at the kettle
---
/* Everything Maud says when Wren talks to her, top of the ladder first.
Conversations are bundle beats (once per run by default, spent by
presentation); barks are repeatable entries. */

<beat id="first" on="talk" target="npc.maud" title="Maud at the kettle" priority="90" once="user">
  @maud{code="0010" emotion="warm"}: Ask, then. Everyone has the same three questions and I've polished the answers.
  @wren{code="0010"}: How long have you been here?
  @maud{code="0020" emotion="wry"}: Long enough to stop climbing. Not long enough to stop wanting to.
  @wren{code="0020"}: Can anyone get out?
  @maud{code="0030"}: Out, yes. Away — that's a different staircase.
  ::set{user.bond.maud += 1}
</beat>

<beat id="count" on="talk" target="npc.maud" title="Maud keeps count" priority="40" once="user" when="user.deaths >= 2 && user.bond.maud >= 2">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Behind the kettle, scratched into the soot, a column of tally marks. The newest ones are clean.
  @wren{code="0010"}: Are those mine?
  @maud{code="0010" emotion="guarded"}: {{user.deaths}} of them. I don't scratch the ones where you get out. Seemed like bad luck.
  ::set{user.bond.maud += 1}
</beat>

<beat id="questions" on="talk" target="npc.maud" title="Questions over the kettle" priority="30" once="user" when="user.bond.maud >= 3 && user.runs >= 3">
  @maud{code="0010"}: Sit. You've got that face. Everybody gets that face around the third climb.
  <hub id="kettle" prompt="Maud pours a second cup and waits.">
    <choice id="oskar" label="What happened to Oskar?" once>
      @maud{code="0020" emotion="guarded"}: He made a hammer for a man he loved and the Stair kept them both. He's been hitting that anvil ever since.
    </choice>
    <choice id="sable" label="Who is Sable?" once when="user.knowsSableName">
      @maud{code="0030" emotion="warm"}: The best climber I ever saw. She got to the top before you were born. She just never got past the Warden.
    </choice>
    <choice id="top" label="What's at the top?" once>
      @maud{code="0040" emotion="wry"}: A door. Everyone who's been through it says it's a door. Nobody who's been through it stays to say more.
    </choice>
    <choice id="enough" label="Thanks, Maud." exit>
      ::set{user.bond.maud += 1}
      @maud{code="0050" emotion="fond"}: Mind the ankles.
    </choice>
  </hub>
</beat>

<entry id="maudBarkAshfall" on="talk" target="npc.maud" category="bark" priority="27" once="season:ashfall" share="ashfallNews" when="user.ashfallOn">
  @maud{code="0010" emotion="warm"}: Ash in your hair. Suits you. Bring me lilies if you see any.
</entry>

<entry id="maudBarkEscaped" on="talk" target="npc.maud" category="bark" priority="25" when="@cameBackFromEscape">
  @maud{code="0010" emotion="fond"}: Tell me about the sky again. Slowly. I want to hear the colours.
</entry>

<entry id="maudBarkHounds" on="talk" target="npc.maud" category="bark" priority="20" when="has(prev.run.fellTo) && prev.run.fellTo == 'cinderhound'">
  @maud{code="0010"}: Ankles, love. I keep telling you. Hounds go for the ankles.
</entry>

<entry id="maudBarkWraith" on="talk" target="npc.maud" category="bark" priority="20" when="has(prev.run.fellTo) && prev.run.fellTo == 'ashwraith'">
  @maud{code="0010" emotion="guarded"}: Wraith again? Don't look at them. Look at where they're going to be.
</entry>

<entry id="maudBarkVeteran" on="talk" target="npc.maud" category="bark" priority="10" when="@veteran">
  @maud{code="0010" emotion="wry"}: You've got a climber's knees now. I can hear them from here.
</entry>

<entry id="maudBarkKettle" on="talk" target="npc.maud" category="bark">
  @maud{code="0010"}: Kettle's on. Kettle's always on.
</entry>
